flowchart TD
  INV[Phase 6W exported-component triage] --> DEDUP[deduplicate manifest rows]
  DEDUP --> OOBE{OOBE activity?}
  OOBE -- yes --> PERM[OOBE_PERMISSION protectionLevel 0x2]
  PERM --> SIG[signature component guard]
  SIG --> SIDE[OOBE setup / OobeHomeActivity side effect]
  OOBE -- no --> BADGE{BadgingProvider?}
  BADGE -- yes --> UID[Binder.getCallingUid]
  UID --> PKGS[PackageManager.getPackagesForUid]
  PKGS --> OWN{caller owns target pkg?}
  OWN -- no --> DENY[return -1]
  OWN -- yes --> UPDATE[badge state only]
  BADGE -- no --> UNKNOWN[bounded closure unknown]
  SHELL[ordinary shell] -. no OOBE signature match .-> SIG
  SHELL -. target package mismatch .-> DENY
  HOME[HOME resolver / system UID] -. no observed edge .-> SIDE
